{"id": "000040", "text": "看见你们真高兴", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": null, "context": "James  Juliet", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是热情欢迎，但结合James与Juliet的语境，更像客套或勉强掩饰，真实情绪偏冷淡被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000008", "text": "我想保护你", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.75, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.8, "dominance": 0.45}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": null, "context": "你想要我怎么样\n拜托让我帮你...\n快回答", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是温柔的保护承诺，但上下文对方反复逼问“快回答”，语气更像被逼到急切辩解、带着无力与焦躁，与字面的从容温柔相矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000104", "text": "这样可以使我们的人民远离毒品", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.75, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": null, "context": "\"货物\"?  你指毒品\n那和我往常的生意不一样  Yemi\n我们要把毒品运出尼日利亚", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是冠冕堂皇的爱国说辞，实为贩毒牟利的虚伪借口，语气冷静而操控性强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000094", "text": "我，呃，在", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "我，老大", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词字面只是迟疑地应答在场，语气词“呃”暴露紧张和不确定，真实情绪偏焦虑、被动，与字面基本一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000061", "text": "给你扔几个馅饼怎么样?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面像好意送好处，但“扔”字带施舍与威胁感，真实语气更像居高临下的挑衅或试探。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000140", "text": "如果你不喜欢这个", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "18年的等待太漫长了", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平静的假设性询问，但结合18年等待的语境，说话人带着试探与不安，怕对方不接受，真实情绪偏负面且略被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000026", "text": "我一直都知道", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "我听说有人要给你一个工作\n你怎么知道的", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面平静陈述，但“一直都知道”暗含掌控感与轻微戒备，语气笃定、略带压迫。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000042", "text": "我希望这样", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "早上好 Eddie\nLocke先生早上好\n你们要去抓几只鸟么?", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是礼貌的期望，语气平淡略带敷衍，真实情绪偏中性偏消极但未明显矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000056", "text": "我没有开玩笑", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.65, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "这不好笑", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平静地否认开玩笑，但结合上文“这不好笑”，实际带着被误解的严肃与不悦，情绪偏负面且较激动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000145", "text": "如果我弄沉了这个岛", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.45}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是假设性担忧，语气中透出不安与自我怀疑，真实情绪更负面且被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000018", "text": "怕什么", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.45}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "是因为害怕吗", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是轻描淡写的反问，显得无所谓；实为被戳中后逞强掩饰，内心不安且防御。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000138", "text": "如果他们想带你回去那就得拿东西来换", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.75}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.8}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "我打算越过那条不应该被越过的界线\n告诉他们你在我们手上", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词是谈判筹码式的威胁，字面冷静但暗含算计与掌控，真实情绪同样偏冷硬强势，无明显反差。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000037", "text": "压制：寂高心", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "迷失", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词“压制：寂高心”字面是下达压制指令，带有掌控感；结合“迷失”语境，说话人真实情绪更显冷峻压抑，支配感强但效价偏低，字面与真实基本一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000054", "text": "因为我们不是杀手  James", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "做做深呼吸瑜伽什么的\n如果你想我死\n为什么不一枪了结了我?", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是冷静澄清、带道德优越感的安抚，但语境中面对求死质问，真实情绪是压抑的沉重与无奈，并非纯正面。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000146", "text": "我是你能负担得起的最好的律师", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.65, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.85}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.9}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "好的\nDawson先生\n你这么辛苦得赶来让我知道了", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词以自信甚至略带傲慢的口吻自抬身价，字面与真实情绪一致，都是强势、掌控感强且带点炫耀。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000106", "text": "但你必须坐着别动", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.75}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.85}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "听我说\n看着我你会没事的知道吗", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是命令式安抚，语气急切而强势，真实情绪是紧张但强作镇定、以掌控姿态稳住对方，两者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000111", "text": "都不是真的", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "John你没说错\n我告诉你的一些事...\n我告诉大家的一些事...", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是坦白承认自己说过的话不真实，带沉重与愧疚；结合上下文断续的铺垫，真实情绪是压抑的紧张与自我贬低，与字面方向一致，只是更激动、更无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000089", "text": "你知道怎么钓鱼吗?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.6}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "我能问你个问题吗?\n我在想你什么时候能爬上来(乐队的地位提升)\n是的我在乐队里是个低音吉他手....", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "表面是普通提问，但结合前文“什么时候能爬上来”的乐队地位话题，实为带调侃意味的暗讽，情绪略偏负面且带主动试探。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000105", "text": "打电话求救", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.8}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "在岛上过了近90天以后\n一艘货轮航班抵达海岸不远处\nJack把大家带到一个信号塔处", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是直接下达求救指令，语气急切而坚定，真实情绪同样充满希望与主动掌控，二者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000100", "text": "如果我不扯出这些线 Locke会把我们炸到", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.55}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.8, "dominance": 0.5}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "什么?\n别把那些线拽出来\n没事的一切都会好好的", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词字面是紧迫的辩解与警告，语气急促焦虑，真实情绪同样是紧张恐惧，两者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000107", "text": "他们总以为他们跑得掉", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "你要去哪儿菜鸟?\n不不不\n不不不不", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面带轻蔑的笃定，语气冷酷自信，暗含掌控与威胁，情绪偏负面但支配感强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000137", "text": "你就住在这里?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是中性询问，但语气带惊讶与轻微质疑，隐含对居住条件的不认可，情绪略偏负面。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000095", "text": "怎么把门弄上去的?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "你怎么...你怎么做到的", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是好奇追问，语气带惊讶与佩服，真实情绪是震惊中夹杂佩服，主动发问但被对方能力压住，情绪一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000139", "text": "为什么是他?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.4}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "我不明白他怎么进去的?\n他得到信任有更高的通行许可", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是中性疑问，但结合上下文对他人获信任的困惑，真实情绪带不甘与质疑，略偏负面且被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000077", "text": "现在当大家知道我在空难中死了以后", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.3}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "陈述自己“被死亡”的假设情境，字面偏负面且带一丝荒诞感，语气平静中隐含无奈与自嘲，两通道基本一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000135", "text": "你们打算什么时候要小孩", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是中性询问，但长辈式追问带施压与审视，真实情绪偏负面、主动掌控，与字面基本一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000144", "text": "Locke则很高兴和他的女友Helen订婚了", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.8, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.8, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.6}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "Sayid一直苦恼于自己的过去\n他还深深爱着Nadia\n但是她却和他哥哥结婚了", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "叙述Locke订婚的喜讯，字面与真实情绪一致，均为正面且较为平静的喜悦。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000085", "text": "千万别被发现", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "马上离开这\n呆在这别让人发现她", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是叮嘱警告，语气紧张急迫，真实情绪是担忧害怕，与字面一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000122", "text": "这是“我们”的事", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "我正在想你所说的\n这不是什么“你我对决”", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词强调共同承担，字面正面且带主动掌控感；结合上下文反驳“你我对决”，真实情绪是坚定而略带克制的拉拢，与字面一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000131", "text": "把她弄到搂上去", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.75}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.85}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是命令把人弄上楼，语气强硬带支配；真实情绪更显急切冷酷，掌控欲强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000010", "text": "你做梦了", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "你还好吧  John?\n很好\n我很好", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "陈述对方做梦，字面中性偏关切；结合前文对方强撑“我很好”，说话人带担忧与试探，情绪略负面但主动关心。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000084", "text": "你回狐狸河监狱", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.75}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.8}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "为了我,Nate\n我需要你这么做\n好吧", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "命令式台词，语气强硬且带有牺牲意味，字面与真实情绪一致，都是负面但掌控感强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000051", "text": "是吗?  我听说的可不是这样的", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "比如呢?\n帮个忙\n我不帮犯人忙的", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "表面是轻描淡写的反问，实则带着试探和施压，暗示对方底细自己清楚，掌控感强于字面。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000005", "text": "保持联络", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "干得漂亮\n那么接下来干什么?\n静观其变", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "例行公事的简短指令，语气平稳中性，略带掌控感，字面与真实情绪一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000072", "text": "你在干嘛?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.5}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "中性询问，字面与真实情绪一致，无明显矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000013", "text": "我们已经启动了Clarie体内的植入设备", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": null, "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "陈述事实语气中性偏掌控，但涉及控制他人身体的植入设备，潜台词带冷峻压迫感，情绪略偏负面。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000057", "text": "不不会听着如果我们不先走", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.35}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.85, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "是这样的短暂\n我们觉得先走一步会好很多\n你会怎么做杀了我?", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "结巴和急促的辩解透出慌张恐惧，字面与真实情绪一致，都是紧张不安、处于被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000102", "text": "过会儿我来找你", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.5}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "怎么了?\n我去海滩上散会儿步", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "语气平和的承诺，字面与真实情绪一致，略带关切与安抚。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000134", "text": "是因为我总能把事情办好?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "有些东西比肉体伤害\n更能让人屈服\n记得以前你信任我", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "表面是平静的确认式提问，带一点试探和自信；结合前文关于让人屈服与信任的暗示，真实情绪更偏冷峻审视，但未构成明显反讽。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000081", "text": "你不能呆在这里你一定得走", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.8}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.85}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "当他这么做的时候你和你母亲\n你们得离开\n以防我的方法行不通", "source": "dgk_lost_conv", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词是急迫的命令式驱赶，字面负面但出于保护，真实情绪是焦急而坚定的关切，两通道一致。", "human_gold": false}
